# Wave 1 Task 1 — E2E isolation artifacts that should never be committed.
# `tests/e2e/harness/.e2e-run-id` is written by the harness when a run starts so
# teardown can find the last run's per-worker prefixes/database names; we
# keep it out of the repo to avoid masking real leaks.
tests/e2e/harness/.e2e-run-id
tests/e2e/harness/.e2e-leftovers.log

# Machine-generated run output, not source: the sanitized a11y report
# (route/rule/selector only) and the Lighthouse reports. Visual baselines are
# deliberately NOT here — they live under tests/e2e/visual and are committed.
tests/artifacts/
# lhci's own working directory, written next to the config it reads.
.lighthouseci/
